# The build context of examples/alert-routing/Dockerfile, which BuildKit reads
# instead of the root .dockerignore. The context is the repository root, and
# the image needs only the Go sources of sigil.wasm, the TypeScript package
# and the example, so everything else is left out, local builds and installs
# above all: node_modules and .next are hundreds of megabytes and would
# shadow what the image builds itself.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/sigil-wasm/
!internal/
!bindings/typescript/
!examples/alert-routing/

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
examples/alert-routing/public/sigil/
examples/alert-routing/.cache/
examples/alert-routing/results/
examples/alert-routing/test-results/
examples/alert-routing/playwright-report/
